    "detailed_description": "God Crafter is a 3D world-building game where you, as a new god, begin by learning the ropes and then creating your own universe.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock periodic elements to create the building blocks of life itself.<br></li><li>Grow more powerful the more you create.<br></li><li>Ensure your humans have everything they need to survive.<br></li><li>Choose to become a benevolent god or the devil himself.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "God Crafter is a 3D world-building game where you, as a new god, begin by learning the ropes and then creating your own universe.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock periodic elements to create the building blocks of life itself.<br></li><li>Grow more powerful the more you create.<br></li><li>Ensure your humans have everything they need to survive.<br></li><li>Choose to become a benevolent god or the devil himself.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "God Crafter is a casual and satisfying 3D clicker game where you, as a god, get to recreate Earth for the humans you create. Shape and design the world with your divine powers. Immerse yourself in a relaxing and rewarding gameplay experience as you build a beautiful and thriving world from scratch.",
